00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.380
it&#x27;s been through the lens of disease

00:14:04.380 --> 00:14:07.500
and what I mean by that is that we have

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:10.980
really focused on studying and

00:14:10.980 --> 00:14:13.380
attempting to treat individual diseases

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:15.180
in isolation and I think the war on

00:14:15.180 --> 00:14:16.980
cancer is a perfect example of this

00:14:16.980 --> 00:14:18.899
where you know a large amount of

00:14:18.899 --> 00:14:20.760
resources were dedicated towards the

00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:22.560
eradication of one disease and trust me

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:24.899
I&#x27;m all for curing cancer or curing

00:14:24.899 --> 00:14:27.240
heart disease but one of the things that

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.940
gets missed with this individual disease

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:33.420
in isolation Focus

00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:36.899
major causes of death and disability in

00:14:36.899 --> 00:14:38.339
the United States and other developed

00:14:38.339 --> 00:14:40.620
Nations have at their root a single

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:43.139
greatest risk factor and it&#x27;s not the

00:14:43.139 --> 00:14:44.579
risk factors that we typically think

00:14:44.579 --> 00:14:46.860
about it&#x27;s not how much you eat or how

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.779
much you weigh or whether you smoke or

00:14:48.779 --> 00:14:51.060
whether you exercise it&#x27;s how old you

00:14:51.060 --> 00:14:52.019
are

00:14:52.019 --> 00:14:54.600
and that&#x27;s important because that tells

00:14:54.600 --> 00:14:57.120
us that there is a

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.699
association between the biological

00:14:59.699 --> 00:15:03.000
changes that happen with age and these

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:06.000
diseases and if we can understand that

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:09.000
biology that&#x27;s driving the aging process

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:11.100
we have the potential to actually

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:14.399
intervene in that biology to modulate

00:15:14.399 --> 00:15:16.620
the onset and progression of many maybe

00:15:16.620 --> 00:15:19.380
all age-related functional declines and

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:21.120
diseases simultaneously and that&#x27;s

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.880
really I think the promise of 21st

00:15:23.880 --> 00:15:25.980
century medicine and it is my hope and

00:15:25.980 --> 00:15:29.160
expectation that we will transition away

00:15:29.160 --> 00:15:31.800
from reactive disease care towards more

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.600
